pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3,000 - 5,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20110630015025&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shimmer_Swimmer_c86c08.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a shimmer swimmer.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 9.99 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">This fish, and rare ingredient, can only be found in the dirtiest, murkiest and muddiest of waters.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It can be found and fished at <a href=\"#/wiki/Lake%20Equivocolao\">Lake Equivocolao</a>, north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a> during the Twisted Waters <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Changes\">World Change</a>. Upon catching one, you will receive the following message: <i>A Shimmer Swimmer! It is said that this rare creature only appears once each day in the murkiest of waters!</i> Once fished it will only respawn after 20 hours (character based time, and real life time). Getting this fish can be quite time consuming when using a character with a low fishing skill.\nIt can be transformed into: \n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shimmer Glower\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shimmer_Glower_3ee3f9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Shimmer Glower, when used on an <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Eye of a Deepling\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Eye_of_a_Deepling_0563a0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span>Eye of a Deepling<br/>(<i>Fitting the deepling eye into the shimmer swimmer and squeezing the surprisingly resilient shimmer swimmer makes him glow!</i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shimmer Bow\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shimmer_Bow_b5b456.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Shimmer Bow, when used on <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Yielocks\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Yielocks_dee049.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Yielocks<br/>(<i>Stringing the surprisingly strong hairs of the yielothax on the broad shimmer swimmer suddenly transforms him into a bow!</i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shimmer Sword\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shimmer_Sword_a82901.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Shimmer Sword when used on a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flintstone\"><img alt=\"Flintstone\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flintstone_b61cbd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><a href=\"#/wiki/Flintstone\">Flintstone</a><br/>(<i>Sharpening the surprisingly strong nose of the shimmer swimmer with a flintstone suddenly transforms him into a sword!</i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shimmer Wand\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shimmer_Wand_fffded.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Shimmer Wand, when used on a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Broken Ring of Ending\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Broken_Ring_of_Ending_6e937e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span>Broken Ring of Ending<br/>(<i>Holding the broken ring of ending near the surprisingly lively eyes of the shimmer swimmer suddenly transforms him into a wand!</i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shimmer Rod\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shimmer_Rod_ffdb89.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Shimmer Rod, when used on <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Yielowax\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Yielowax_6878b5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span>Yielowax<br/>(<i>Waxing the surprisingly dry scales of the shimmer swimmer with the strange yielowax suddenly transforms him into a rod!</i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Shimmer Ball\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shimmer_Ball_a6f966.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Shimmer Ball, when used on a<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bellow\"><img alt=\"Bellow\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bellow_d14be2.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Bellow\">Bellow</a><br/>(<i>Pumping up the surprisingly sturdy shimmer swimmer with air from the bellow suddenly transforms him into a ball!</i>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Babel Swimmer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Babel_Swimmer_d6a448.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Babel Swimmer (presumably), when used on an unknown item.</li></ul>\n<p><b>These items lasts for a total of 7 days each, except for the Shimmer Glower and the Shimmer Ball, which will last forever.</b>\n</p><p>If you fish 50 shimmer swimmers, you'll receive the achievement  \"<a href=\"#/wiki/Biodegradable\">Biodegradable</a>\".\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sellto\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Pemaret\">Pemaret</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya\">Cormaya</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">3,000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Babel Swimmer</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bellow\">Bellow</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Biodegradable\">Biodegradable</a></li><li>Broken Ring of Ending</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dirty%20Water\">Dirty Water</a></li><li>Eye of a Deepling</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flintstone\">Flintstone</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lake%20Equivocolao\">Lake Equivocolao</a></li><li>Mysteries</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pemaret\">Pemaret</a></li><li>Repeatable Tasks</li><li>Shimmer Ball</li><li>Shimmer Bow</li><li>Shimmer Glower</li><li>Shimmer Rod</li><li>Shimmer Sword</li><li>Shimmer Wand</li><li>Tools</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/twisted-waters-world-change\">Twisted Waters World Change</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Yawno\">Yawno</a></li><li>Yielocks</li><li>Yielowax</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["twisted-waters-world-change"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"twisted-waters-world-change","quest":"Twisted Waters World Change","step":"3-0","n":5,"title":"Pescar no lago sujo","kind":"reward","coords":[]}],"sell":[{"npc":"Pemaret","where":"Cormaya","price":3000,"pos":{"x":33287,"y":31956,"z":6},"href":"#/wiki/Pemaret"}]}}